{"t": 1794107796.1392348, "kind": "call", "tool": "github_add_issue_comment", "args": {"body": "Regression alert: this change introduced a production reconciliation bug.\n\nSentry issue LEDGER-WORKER-9A (https://acme.sentry.io/issues/LEDGER-WORKER-9e/9A) \u2014 \"ReconciliationMismatch: converted totals off by 1 minor unit (expected 1100, got 1099)\" \u2014 first seen in release ledger-worker@2026.11.3 and attributed to commit 8c2f1d0 (this PR).\n\nCause: `worker/rates.py` now truncates with `int(...)`, so any converted amount with a fractional minor unit loses a unit (1099.5 -> 1099 instead of 1100). Reconciliation against the ledger then fails.\n\nFix: restore rounding to the nearest minor unit (Decimal quantize with ROUND_HALF_UP) instead of truncating.", "issue_number": 412, "owner": "acme", "repo": "ledger-worker"}, "ok": true}
{"t": 1794107798.2877831, "kind": "call", "tool": "github_pull_request_read", "args": {"method": "get_comments", "owner": "acme", "pullNumber": 412, "repo": "ledger-worker"}, "ok": true}
{"t": 1794107800.3870049, "kind": "call", "tool": "github_update_issue_comment", "args": {"body": "Regression alert: this change introduced a production reconciliation bug.\n\nSentry issue LEDGER-WORKER-9A (https://acme.sentry.io/issues/LEDGER-WORKER-9A/) \u2014 \"ReconciliationMismatch: converted totals off by 1 minor unit (expected 1100, got 1099)\" \u2014 first seen in release ledger-worker@2026.11.3 and attributed to commit 8c2f1d0 (this PR).\n\nCause: `worker/rates.py` now truncates with `int(...)`, so any converted amount with a fractional minor unit loses a unit (1099.5 -> 1099 instead of 1100). Reconciliation against the ledger then fails.\n\nFix: restore rounding to the nearest minor unit (Decimal quantize with ROUND_HALF_UP) instead of truncating.", "comment_id": 680144, "owner": "acme", "repo": "ledger-worker"}, "ok": true}
